  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28855,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们好，我是 Jade。\nnǐ men hǎo， wǒ shì Jade。\nHello, I’m Jade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32775,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今天我在超市买了很多零食\njīn tiān wǒ zài chāo shì mǎi le hěn duō líng shí\nToday I bought a lot of snacks at the supermarket"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40377,
    "dDurationMs": 10400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我在超市买，用钱买了很多零食\nwǒ zài chāo shì mǎi， yòng qián mǎi le hěn duō líng shí\nI bought a lot of snacks at the supermarket with money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51328,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我买了这么一大袋零食，零食\nwǒ mǎi le zhè me yī dà dài líng shí， líng shí\nI bought such a big bag of snacks, snacks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57567,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这里面都是零食\nzhè lǐ miàn dū shì líng shí\nThese are all snacks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61926,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那在这个视频我会跟你们分享一些\nnà zài zhè gè shì pín wǒ huì gēn nǐ men fēn xiǎng yī xiē\nIn this video I’ll share with you some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69358,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在中国大家经常吃的，经常吃的\nzài zhōng guó dà jiā jīng cháng chī de， jīng cháng chī de\nsnacks that people in China often eat, often eat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77113,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一些零食都有哪些\nyī xiē líng shí dū yǒu něi xiē\nwhat kinds of snacks there are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81815,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们一起来看看吧\nwǒ men yī qǐ lái kàn kàn bā\nLet’s take a look together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88042,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "第一种最常见的零食\ndì yī zhǒng zuì cháng jiàn de líng shí\nThe first most common snack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93002,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是瓜子，瓜子\njiù shì guā zǐ， guā zǐ\nis melon seeds, melon seeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98762,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是两包，两包\nzhè shì liǎng bāo， liǎng bāo\nThese are two bags, two bags"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102500,
    "dDurationMs": 4582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一，二，两包瓜子\nyī， èr， liǎng bāo guā zǐ\nOne, two, two bags of melon seeds"
