  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107722,
    "dDurationMs": 7840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "瓜子，瓜子是一种很常见的零食\nguā zǐ， guā zǐ shì yī zhǒng hěn cháng jiàn de líng shí\nMelon seeds are a very common snack"
