    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "鸡脚，它也是一种零食\njī jiǎo， tā yě shì yī zhǒng líng shí\nChicken feet are also a kind of snack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682863,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "嗯，虽然它也算是肉\nňg， suī rán tā yě suàn shì ròu\nMm, although it also counts as meat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686143,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它也算一种肉\ntā yě suàn yī zhǒng ròu\nIt also counts as a kind of meat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688463,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "嗯，因为毕竟它是从鸡\nňg， yīn wèi bì jìng tā shì cóng jī\nMm, because after all, it comes from a chicken"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692303,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从鸡这种动物身上来的\ncóng jī zhè zhǒng dòng wù shēn shàng lái de\nIt comes from a chicken, this kind of animal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696303,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以它也算一种肉\nsuǒ yǐ tā yě suàn yī zhǒng ròu\nSo it also counts as a kind of meat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699343,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是，它也是零食\ndàn shì， tā yě shì líng shí\nBut it is also a snack"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702688,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "零食，很多人在中国\nlíng shí， hěn duō rén zài zhōng guó\nA snack, a lot of people in China"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706288,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很多人喜欢在喝酒\nhěn duō rén xǐ huān zài hē jiǔ\nA lot of people like to eat chicken feet when drinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709808,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "喝酒的时候吃鸡脚\nhē jiǔ de shí hòu chī jī jiǎo\nThey eat chicken feet while drinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713328,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "鸡脚配酒\njī jiǎo pèi jiǔ\nChicken feet and alcohol"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715728,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在喝酒的时候吃鸡脚\nzài hē jiǔ de shí hòu chī jī jiǎo\nEating chicken feet while drinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719168,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它是辣的，辣的吃起来\nyīn wèi tā shì là de， là de chī qǐ lái\nBecause it is spicy, spicy food tastes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722928,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很辣很辣\nhěn là hěn là\nVery spicy, very spicy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724608,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "嗯，我夹一块给你们看一下\nňg， wǒ jiā yī kuài gěi nǐ men kàn yī xià\nMm, I'll pick up a piece and show you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728744,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这就是鸡脚的一部分\nzhè jiù shì jī jiǎo de yī bù fēn\nThis is part of a chicken foot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731944,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "鸡的脚的一部分\njī de jiǎo de yī bù fēn\nPart of a chicken's foot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734584,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它的其中一部分\ntā de qí zhōng yī bù fēn\nIt's one part of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737224,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以这就是中国人也会吃的一种零食\nsuǒ yǐ zhè jiù shì zhōng guó rén yě huì chī de yī zhǒng líng shí\nSo this is a snack that Chinese people also eat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742104,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是鸡脚，鸡脚，泡椒凤爪\njiù shì jī jiǎo， jī jiǎo， pào jiāo fèng zhǎo\nIt's chicken feet, chicken feet, pickled pepper chicken claws"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746664,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也是鸡脚\nyě shì jī jiǎo\nIt's also chicken feet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748609,
    "dDurationMs": 4055,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不知道你们会不会觉得有点吓人\nbù zhī dào nǐ men huì bù huì jué de yǒu diǎn xià rén\nI don't know if you think it looks a bit scary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753144,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有点吓人，因为我大概知道在国外很多人\nyǒu diǎn xià rén， yīn wèi wǒ dà gài zhī dào zài guó wài hěn duō rén\nA bit scary, because I probably know that in other countries a lot of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757784,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不会吃鸡的这个部分\nbú huì chī jī de zhè gè bù fèn\nDon't eat this part of the chicken"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760344,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以它有一些特别\nsuǒ yǐ tā yǒu yī xiē tè bié\nSo it's a bit unusual"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763144,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有一些特别\nyǒu yī xiē tè bié\nA bit unusual"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765064,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "总之这个就是在中国也比较常见的一种\nzǒng zhī zhè gè jiù shì zài zhōng guó yě bǐ jiào cháng jiàn de yī zhǒng\nAnyway, this is a fairly common kind of snack in China"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769704,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "零食，因为它会\nlíng shí， yīn wèi tā huì\nSnack, because it will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773864,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它会就像这样放在包装里面\ntā huì jiù xiàng zhè yàng fàng zài bāo zhuāng lǐ miàn\nIt comes packaged like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777464,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "把它包装起来，然后在超市还有便利店\nbǎ tā bāo zhuāng qǐ lái， rán hòu zài chāo shì huán yǒu biàn lì diàn\nIt's packaged up, and then in supermarkets and convenience stores"
    } ]
  }, {
