    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786904,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "买到这种泡椒凤爪\nmǎi dào zhè zhǒng pào jiāo fèng zhǎo\nBuy this kind of pickled pepper chicken claws"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789224,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以它也是中国比较常见的一种零食\nsuǒ yǐ tā yě shì zhōng guó bǐ jiào cháng jiàn de yī zhǒng líng shí\nSo it's also a fairly common snack in China"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793704,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但可能对外国人来说会有一些特别\ndàn kě néng duì wài guó rén lái shuō huì yǒu yī xiē tè bié\nBut for foreigners, it may be a bit unusual"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797884,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有，这就是泡椒\nhuán yǒu， zhè jiù shì pào jiāo\nAlso, this is pickled peppers"
